rum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T14:49:21-07:00","id":256841,"title":"","content":"Ok, it\u2019s time to check back on the fae of Malibu Dream House. Let\u2019s see what they are up to.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XII</i><br /> <br /> <b>Gawain\u2019s Memories</b><br /> <br /> (May 9th cont.)<br /> <br /> Of course, being Friday, we have a big show to prep for, with Lori headlining again and Ace MCing. He\u2019d blacked out a little, last night before the rest of us fought briar wolves, and according to him, he\u2019d saved up all that energy for tonight, and it sounds like he\u2019ll need it. See, he\u2019d gotten inspired by the outfit he wore to the Rose and Thorn, so he decided to do the whole Thunderdome bit from Mad Max, all by himself, as a kinda half time show, you know? When he got to asking for a chainsaw (it wouldn\u2019t be fair if one of his characters had a fire axe and the other didn\u2019t have anything, right?), Lori got really confused. It turns out she\u2019d never seen any of the Mad Max movies! So they\u2019re fixing that now - her and Calamity and sometimes Ace. Insincere Marguerite declared Australians were too ugly, and Jacob conscripted me to help cure the hides we\u2019d gotten. I did say I wanted to learn that sorta stuff, so I can\u2019t complain, even if the occasional shrieks and gasps made things sound super interesting, you know?<br /> <br /> <br /> May 10th<br /> <br /> Well, this weekend has been great so far. Started out with a super successful briar wolf hunting date night, followed by crazy sex with the woman I love, followed by a killer show, then some pretty sweet sex with a beautiful dancer. Then, after an awesome breakfast, if I do say so myself, I got to work with my hands, along with everyone else, to improve the place we all lived in (kinda) and I learned that Lori would totally have sex with me if I wanted some time maybe. Or she would have before. Either way, I\u2019m really kinda wondering when I died and how I got into heaven, you know?<br /> <br /> So to try and get things remembered all in order - the show was killer. Annika and Ginny has some awesome acts, and Chalcedony and the other dancers were back and beautiful as ever. Ace\u2019s Thunderdome bit went over perfectly, he even pulled off Master Blaster with one of Insincere Marguerite\u2019s puppets riding on his back. She said its name was Jeremy Fisher, and he, I guess I should call it a he, gave his permission even. She can be very strange sometimes. She had her own acts too - she didn\u2019t perform but she announced them (wearing a really short skirt and a tiny vest thing, she looked super hot. Plus she had an adorable Cat in the Hat kinda hat on, to match her socks, you know) and choreographed them.<br /> <br /> And then there was Lori. I feel a little bad, you know, cause I don\u2019t really remember what she sang, just that it was the most beautiful thing I\u2019d ever heard sung, like, ever. The crowd was eating it up too. It was, just... wow. She seemed a little high on it herself, and was super flirty with the girls as she got actually drunk.<br /> <br /> I checked up on Ginny after the show was over, to make certain she\u2019d gotten home alright, and wasn\u2019t in any trouble, you know? She didn\u2019t seem to mind me checking up, but said she was ok. I hung with Jacob for awhile too, while Calamity had a cigar with Annika, long enough to back him up with Ace and his punch bowl. See, Ace decided that the regular mixed drinks didn\u2019t have enough \u201cor death\u201d to them, so he found a punch bowl in the kitchen, and filled it with some of every color of alcohol. I convinced Lori not to drink it, though mostly by accident, cause she thought we said it had eggs in it. Up until then, she just kept telling me I wasn\u2019t her dad. She was really drunk. So, only Ace had any of his concoction, which probably explains why he was laid out on the table when I got back for breakfast this morning.<br /> <br /> Calamity made a beeline for Dark Kimberly and Davie when she got back from cigars. She seemed like she had an awesome night - she was certainly pleased with herself this morning. She made sure to give me a good morning kiss too while I was making breakfast, and pull me aside while we were working later to make sure I was ok, but it was kinda what we talked about, you know? She said she thought about inviting me, maybe, or was maybe just teasing with Insincere Marguerite and Lori, but I told her that was alright. Maybe if Davie hadn\u2019t been there, but him being there would have made it at least a little weird. For me, at least. Completely, all the way honestly, I\u2019m a little bit nervous thinking about being with Calamity with other people. The look in her eyes when she talks or gets to thinking about other people she\u2019s had sex with is a little, I dunno, uncomfortable? I mean, if she\u2019s cool with it, and they\u2019re cool with it, it\u2019s cool and all, you know? And it\u2019s not like it wouldn\u2019t be hot, being with two smoking ladies and all. So, I\u2019m conflicted, I guess I\u2019m saying. Maybe you\u2019ve figured it out already and all. Seems like at least it\u2019s one of those good things to talk about at least.<br /> <br /> Anyways, I went to Chalcedony\u2019s place, with her of course. Jacob had my back - he remembers everybody\u2019s favorite drink orders, so he hooked me up with one for her. I can\u2019t bag on Lori too hard for being drunk, since I was too, just a little, but I\u2019m more charming when I\u2019m drunk. Lori is just always super charming, drunk or not. I was pretty charming last night, I guess, so we wound going back to hers like I said. Her place was all over blue, decorations and furniture and even down to the lighting. It was really striking, especially the particular shade of the blue lights in her bedroom, you know, playing over her skin.<br /> <br /> I did duck out in time to make breakfast again. I\u2019d be a little lost without the \u201cmorning\u201d routine, especially on mornings after nightmares. None last night though! Breakfast was sausage and egg casserole this time, with some cinnamon toast. Ace didn\u2019t even eat anything crazy this time, except for a hunk of cheese he got to go with his casserole, that he occasionally petted and dunked into his punchbowl of alcohol. He was very happy to have something with eggs in it at least.<br /> <br /> We started working on the Hedge House, once we\u2019d sent Davie and Dark Kimberly back home. We decided to fix up people\u2019s rooms, get it to being more comfortable, you know, in addition to beefing up security by putting in extra wards and stuff. Ace was full of ideas - more dead things on sticks, self-launching stained glass windows, killer plants. We talked him out of most of it, though killer plants does sound super awesome. All in all, it was a fun time, doing something constructive with my hands, even if that something is being a ladder/scaffolding and holding Calamity up so she could get to stuff on the second floor and roof.<br /> <br /> We started out talking about music and games and stuff, cause Lori is not cool with how much culture and stuff she\u2019s missed. She was especially not cool to hear that a couple of the Beatles were dead. Calamity said I should bring all my games stuff over, which I was thinking about anyway. We could get a killer setup in the guest bedroom where the girls were watching Amelie the other night. And Lori really, really needs to play some Rock Band. Like, yesterday. I could probably scrounge up the Beatles version even.<br /> <br /> We talked some about musical theatre too. Lori was super thrilled to figure out the Les Mis was a musical now, and Phantom of the Opera. I don\u2019t have either of those in any particular form, so we might have to go on a big scrounging for DVDs hunt. Also, I need to learn some Bryan Adams songs. Apparently, Kat really liked him. It\u2019d mostly be just a joke - I even mentioned it, and she said it wouldn\u2019t mean quite the same thing anymore. But I still think it\u2019d be fun. Probably not for on stage, or anything, but for singing around the House, and maybe getting a CD for dancing, you know?<br /> <br /> We talked a lot abo