bconsciously as I wrote and that shows through. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> On another note, as for Lori's speech to the monarchs... well, as she states in the entry, she didn't quite pull out <i>all</i> the stops. She didn't use any contracts or anything like that, though she did use her Seeming ability to add dice and spent a Willpower on the roll. And she had bonus dice due to Merits and such, of course. While the roll wasn't quite as overwhelming as her usual performance rolls, it was still pretty heavily stacked in her favor.<br /> <br /> As always, thanks for reading!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2591-penitenttom","name":"PenitentTom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2591_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T08:00:02-07:00","id":682067,"title":"","content":"Looks like something's up with Chalcedony.<br /> The whole thing with Dark Kimberly, White Maria and Becky Wan makes me think Changeling needs an entitlement specialized in mediating conflicts.<br /> Am I the only one whom Julia somewhat reminds of Balance of Shadows' Natalie? I mean, they're both lesbian goth artists with a foot fetish.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T11:52:29-07:00","id":682252,"title":"","content":"Chalcedony and Desiree have been people an eye have been on throughout the game.<br /> <br /> There is Legacy of the Black Apple, but that is not quite the same thing.<br /> <br /> Maybe a little? Julia is blonde and a half foot taller than Natalie, and tends to be shy vs. very outgoing, so visually they are radically different. They do both like feet, though Natalie has a pretty intense fetish (as in bare feet give bonus dice to influence her), while Julia its just something she likes. Still, they are also both notably subs, and both poly, though Julia is really only poly because of Insincere Marguerite's influence and Lori's intense charisma. So I guess I can see it, I don't see them as similar characters but they do have a lot in common. Which works fine with how you phrased it.<br /> <br /> Julia is more stabby tho.<br /> <br /> Technically they met when I ran the Halloween one shot <i>Malibu Scream House </i>last year which had characters from <i>Malibu Dream House</i>, <i>Night Train Detective Agency</i>, <i>Balance of Shadows</i>, <i>Beyond the Sea</i>, and a Requiem game set in Bucharest run by Jasmine/Alice's player. Sadly there were no journals from that game, which would have been out of time anyway given none of the four ongoing games have hit October 31st 2014 yet.<br /> <br /> ETA: I hope this post did not come off as me arguing, it was not intended as such and I apologize if it did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 09-30-2015, 03:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T16:26:35-07:00","id":682427,"title":"","content":"Nah, that was just informative. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-02T11:32:03-07:00","id":685995,"title":"","content":"PenitentTom: That is an interesting coinciding of thoughts. I know why I thought of the Rat King. I can only why you did though. Still, rather amusing indeed and possible inpiration for fae or hedge beast for our dear Baron to throw at the motley.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4217-amberghylles\">Amberghylles</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4217-amberghylles\">:</a></b> Additionally, Shadowrun: Hong Kong gave me a name to apply to the thoughts that cropped up in my head, but was not the cause of me applying the name. If that makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T13:21:18-07:00","id":687427,"title":"","content":"These are the events that took place between the above session and the session coming your way next weekend<br /> <b><br /> Downtime for July 2nd-July 13th</b><br /> <br /> Monica and Hailey had a falling out right after the events of last session. The particulars are not known but they apparently studiously avoid each other right now. There is no hostility, no turning people against each other, or really any drama, but according to De La Rocha they are not talking and not associating. Monica does not care to talk about it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yesterday more serious shit went down. Dark Kimberly went to Court, and got into an argument with Becky. There was a big stink and Flores bodily blocked the two from each other. Most sources say Dark Kimberly made a biting comment that caused Becky to lash out, though Davey says it was because Flores was letting down her guard. Regardless, Flores bodily blocked Becky\u2019s attack and went down bleeding. It was one hit, she survived being an elemental, but the shock caused an immediate end to the conflict, with both women slinking off. Flores, for her part, was in a place with several healers and recovered, and made it clear no one should go gunning for either Becky or Dark Kimberly as a result of this and she would be angry if they did. This has raised tensions at the court a bit.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Chalcedony, according to Insincere Marguerite, has continued being suspicious. Insincere Marguerite speculates she in interacting with different groups of people different days, few of them Changelings. She continues to run hot and cold with Ginny whoever she is dealing with at the time. There is some evidence she may be reacting to programming, but it is too early to say, and there is no evidence regardless. It is clear she and Desiree are spying on each other.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Desiree for her part has spent some time with Jolie, but so has Felicity. After one such meeting Jolie had a (political) meeting with Olivia Gold, the specifics of which are not known.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Some people are getting concerned Andromeda has not been seen in some time. Joan has told you she is recovering and would not want to be seen until she mostly has. Currently, Andromeda plans to be out at Highsummer.<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> Stay tuned for next time, where Calamity and Lori investigate the attack on Flores, Insincere Marguerite has a weeping breakdown, and everyone plays laser tag. Also, Sleepy Hollow and Edward Scissorhands. See you then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.