e Freehold?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre you?\u201d I asked seriously. I don\u2019t want to believe this about myself, but I think a tiny part of me enjoyed turning the tables on her for her earlier question about my relationship with Joan and Andromeda.<br /> <br /> She looked a little hurt. \u201cWill it matter how I answer that?\u201d she asked. \u201cNo, I don\u2019t have any ulterior motives this time, okay?\u201d<br /> <br /> I nodded. \u201cFor what it\u2019s worth, I believe you,\u201d I said to soften my interrogation. \u201cI just\u2026 well, like I said, Jolie is\u2026 I don\u2019t want to see her get hurt,\u201d I finished lamely. What can I say? I\u2019m reconciled to the fact that Jolie may never be more than a Friend-With-Benefits to me, but she still has her hooks in my heart in a major way.<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t intend to hurt her, Lori,\u201d Desiree said. She knows enough about relationships to state it as an intention rather than an absolute fact, which is comforting on some level. Then she pushed me up against a wall and gave me a passionate kiss. \u201cI\u2019ll be careful with her, I promise,\u201d she said breathily as we separated, \u201cas long as you promise to do the same with Joan.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDeal,\u201d I agreed, and we parted.<br /> <br /> I sought out D next. She was hanging out in our bedroom, so she wasn\u2019t hard to find. \u201cI need to talk to you about Joan,\u201d I said after closing the door behind me.<br /> <br /> \u201cEverything okay?\u201d she asked, concerned.<br /> <br /> \u201cI hope so,\u201d I replied, \u201cbut I\u2019m not really sure. Desiree noticed the looks we were giving each other last night at the show\u2026 and if she noticed, other people probably did too. Joan asked me to keep our relationship a secret, but that\u2019s probably out the window now.\u201d<br /> <br /> D nodded. \u201cIt was bound to come out sooner or later. I know you promised, babe, but Joan will understand. From what I\u2019m hearing, she had as much to do with letting it slip as you did.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThere\u2019s more,\u201d I said in return. \u201cLast night, we were talking, and Joan said\u2026 she said\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat?\u201d D asked, perplexed.<br /> <br /> \u201cShe expressed the opinion that I am in love with her,\u201d I admitted.<br /> <br /> D stopped short. \u201cAre you?\u201d she asked after a moment. There was no judgment there, no jealousy, and I was comforted by the absolute certainty that no matter how I answered her nothing would change between us.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2026 don\u2019t know,\u201d I answered noncommittally but truly. \u201cI care about them both so much. I feel so close to them. They\u2019re both so special to me. But\u2026 dammit, D, I\u2019m so afraid of fucking up what the two of them have together. I <u>can\u2019t</u> be responsible for that. And this\u2026 it was so sudden, I have to wonder if she\u2019s projecting\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> D chewed on that for a minute. \u201cWhy are you telling me this?\u201d she asked. \u201cYou just want to get it off your chest, or are you asking me something?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou\u2019re her best friend, Maria,\u201d I said helplessly. \u201cI was hoping you could talk to her.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI can try,\u201d D said doubtfully, \u201cbut you know she always gets kinda funny when she\u2019s talking to me about you.\u201d<br /> <br /> I nodded. \u201cI\u2019m not asking you to fix this for me. I just don\u2019t want to hurt her\u2026 but I think we might need to pull back a little bit on this relationship and talk things out to see where we all stand. I don\u2019t want to blindside her with that conversation, and I don\u2019t want her to think that I don\u2019t care about her\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> D nodded. \u201cI got it. I\u2019ll do my best.\u201d Then she gave me a kiss and I headed off to work with Calamity on our upcoming act.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s Saturday, so Oleander should be at the show tonight, and I\u2019m expecting to spend the night at her place. I haven\u2019t seen her in about a week, and that more than anything else really brings home to me the problems with having too many significant others. Oleander doesn\u2019t live here, so I don\u2019t see her as often as I see my other girls. She hasn\u2019t complained about this fact (beyond the occasional wry comment), but I don\u2019t want her to feel like she\u2019s a \u201csecond tier\u201d lover to me or anything like that. I love her deeply, and I want to make sure she knows that. Maybe I can talk to her about spending more time at the Dream House during the week or something, or making arrangements for me to visit her between weekend shows.<br /> <br /> Oh, before I sign off to get ready for the show, I wanted to mention the <u>wonderful</u> plan Gawain and Calamity came up with for Thanksgiving. While Marguerite, Maria, Julia and I are going to be spending the day up in Anaheim with Julia\u2019s folks, the rest of the motley hadn\u2019t made specific plans for the holiday. We talked at breakfast this morning about closing the Dream House for Thursday and Friday because of the Holiday (and something called \u201cBlack Friday\u201d with which I\u2019m unfamiliar; the day after Thanksgiving was always the start of the Christmas season and a big shopping day, but apparently that tradition has sort of exploded over the past few decades), but now it seems like they\u2019re going to keep the House open in a limited fashion.<br /> <br /> They\u2019re going to host a traditional Thanksgiving dinner for all the members of the Freehold who have not been able to reconnect with their families. Gawain is already planning the meal, and it sounds wonderful. The thoughtfulness behind this suggestion literally brought a tear to my eye.<br /> <br /> I truly love being a part of this motley.<br /> <br /> <b>Lorelei Grace</b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T13:31:55-07:00","id":959414,"title":"","content":"<b>Calamity\u2019s Little Black Book</b><br /> <br /> Saturday, November 21th<br /> Nine years, seven months<br /> Days without stabbing: 3<br /> <br /> Make you crawl... Make you beg... Make you bleed...<br /> <br /> So, listening to this song for several hours yesterday and today has only managed to burn it into my head. Lori was right, it really does suit me perfectly. The act is coming together wonderfully. We'll have it ready to debut next Saturday when we reopen after the holidays. The hard part is going to be getting Vainglory down well enough. It was Lori's idea and she's the one that started to teach me but if I can get the contract down I am going to be able to allow my true self to show while we do the number which will really seal the whole thing. Afterward, the non enchanted will do that whole make mental excuses thing and write it off as a really impressive costume but for the moment it will be awesome and the glamour should be well over nine thousand.<br /> <br /> Closing for Thanksgiving was pretty much a given and we're going to go ahead and stay down for Black Friday as well. Be good to let our staff have time with their families and all. And as it came up that the quad are going to be at Julia's parent's house for Thanksgiving we started to talk about what the rest of us were going to be doing. I thought about my birthday and how if the motley hadn't really gone to effort to throw me a party and all and make sure I knew I had a family with them I would have almost assuredly spiraled off into self-guilt and depression and gotten drunk and done something monumentally stupid. There was already a plan for the rest of us to have our own dinner but I put forth that we should open it to all the local Changelings. That everyone that didn't have a home and family to go to should have a place to come and be with friends who understood. Gawain loved it of course. The rest seemed to really think it was a good idea as well. You know what they say about broken clocks, guess it was my time to be right.<br /> <br /> Make you want... Make you hurt... Make you need...<br /> <br /> So switching gears last night was a little hard. I really had the new act in my head but it was Friday night and I had a show to do. I had cycled Little Red Riding Hood back up. It hasn't been that long since I did it leading up to Halloween but what can I say, I really like that number and I nailed it. I guess I was just in a really dangerous mood and it carried over well. Of course, I am pretty sure my court were the only ones that didn't forget it as soon as Lori took the stage but she is the headliner for a reason. And my tryst with Leanne seemed to be on more people's minds than my act anyway. White Maria caught me off guard. I mean we hit it off well when I started working with her to learn Tai Chi and we've spent even more time around each other with me adding in Jujitsu lessons recently. But to have her come out and call me a friend directly while making it clear that she was prepared to do some harm to Leanne over what happened was a surprise. And once I made it clear that I had left entirely of my own will (or lack of will maybe, but it was still on me not her) and hinted at there being some issues stemming from my time in Arcadia she was quite understanding. She made it clear she didn't want me to say more than I was comfortable with and she indicated that she understands. She also quietly made a comment about seeing Insincere Marguerite being bad for her. I know how she can be and I can make some guesses there. But it was a much too public venue for either of us to say more. I think I am going to at least try to bring it up with her Monday morning. I mean, I should talk to someone about this shit and someone who understands would be a good choice, right? <br /> <br /> I also spoke to Madam Spidertoes about Leanne. That was... intense and a bit uncomfortable. I'd made my way over to pay my respects and all and we'd spoken about the show I was working up for next Saturday and all. And Leanne came up and when it came out that there had been some risk to me she because very upset. No one harms or kills one of HER Darklings without her leave. The sheer possessiveness of it had my hackles bristled but I managed to hold myself in check and focus on coaxing her back from that cold fury instead of pointing out that I am not hers. In the end, she seemed content with 'having a little chat' with Leanne to make sure she understood what would happen if she killed me or one of the other Darklings without Madam Spidertoes leave. Now, as long as she follows protocol and clears it, I can only assume it would be fine. Okay, that was unkind. But the notion of the two of them discussing me like chattel irks me. I don't belong to anyone. Despite how matronly Spidertoes feels toward all Darklings or how fucking deeply I might have subbed out to Leanne. Though that, at least, seems to be taken care of. At this point, I'll be surprised if Leanne so much as looks in my direction again. I can't imagine another night with me is worth this much fucking grief. And fuck... If White Maria knows and was asking if she needed to do harm then I am sure Becky does. I had better call her later and make sure she hasn't done anything rash yet... or at the very least offer to help her dispose of the body.<br /> <br /> Apparently just being nearby when Spidertoes got all scary possessive set DLR and Annika on edge. I didn't directly speak to DLR but Lori did and they were both gone before much longer. Annika was a little off when we were enjoying our post show cigars but not terribly out of sorts. You know, back when we still talked, Insincere Marguerite had offhandedly suggested that we should get her and Spidertoes back together since they were apparently both saner when they were a couple. At the time I dismissed the idea but seeing how she was clearly effected and how DLR remains deeply affected by that woman maybe it would be better to get them back together before Spidertoes picks a new favorite pet from her Darklings to inflict with permanent mental damage. <br /> <br /> And yeah, she's stopped avoiding me but Insincere Marguerite still isn't really talking TO me. I caught her before the show last night, as I was clearing the stage and she was heading to the catwalks. I mentioned that her performance had been good and asked her when she was going to start working on another. She didn't have an answer, I don't think she's been planning to get back into the spotlight. I didn't really push, but I did reaffirm that she was good. I think she needed to hear it. I mean, she was good, damn good for her first performance. But she hasn't seemed eager to return and I suspect that being anything less than perfect is unacceptable. I certainly had to deal with that demon sharing the stage with Annika and Lori. But after we spoke she nodded and said she'd think about it and then she thanked me and after a moment of hesitation she hugged me. It's the first time she's really touched me since she slapped me and it made me realize just how much I've missed that closeness. It was careful, wary... and that hurts. But it was a step back toward what we had. I shouldn't put too much weight into it. Even if we get closer, we'll never be like we were. She'll never trust me like she did again. <br /> <br /> And maybe it makes me a terrible person and maybe I shouldn't hate her for being the focus of our falling out but I can't help it. I hate Chalcedony for her part in it. And maybe I am letting my feelings stoke my already overactive paranoia but for fuck's sake, it is NOT normal that everyone who watches her falls stupid, head over heels in love with that woman. She's beautiful, yes. But when spying on her leads to fawning over her and attacking people for speaking ill of her it's suspect. When it happens to all three people who have watched her, it's awfully damn suspicious. Insincere Marguerite doesn't fawn over anyone. For good or ill, she takes those that catch her fancy and she makes them hers, not the other way around. And maybe her new-found interest in being a real girl is to blame but Molly letting her see her and getting so lost in her eyes that she can't remember the conversation? I don't trust it and I don't trust her. I called Dahlia to express my concerns and she assured me that while she does want rather muchly to bend Chalcedony over and fuck her like the whore she is she isn't in love with her. After I voiced my fears, she promised me that if she felt herself developing any feelings for the woman she'd have her sniped. And I... I may have smiled at the thought. I know I am not being objective but I can't help it. Right now I'd be hard pressed to keep from jumping for joy if Dahlia did end up putting the little blue cunt down. <br /> <br /> And so, after that conversation, I was standing on the deck trying to cool myself down before going back in when Handsome appeared carrying my favorite loyalist perched on his left arm and hanging all over him. They were giggling and smiling and looking for me. I love Handsome and Desiree is fucking gorgeous and pretty damn amazing in bed so I was more than happy enough to be found and scooped up to join the festivities. Now, I am pretty sure I only know how good Desiree is first hand because I'm the occasional price of doing Gawain but she really does care for him. And if that means that he was the focus of two ladies last night... well I don't think he had any complaints about it. And maybe the two of us didn't fall into the bonus lightning round when he got up to make breakfast this morning but it wasn't like things were awkward being alone and naked with her either. <br /> <br /> So yeah, at this point, I really don't doubt her intentions toward us. She still holds the Director in more esteem than I am comfortable with, but I do understand it and don't blame her. Really I just worry that he could leverage it against her. But she has proven herself to be a friend and she's really trying to reconnect with Gloria. I do consider her a reformed loyalist now. I may speak to Gloria if I get a chance. She's been asking us about Desiree. Seems they've spoken of forming a motley and getting a place together. I've told her that if I don't think Desiree has ill intent. I think seeing her friend may have really have been the bit that cliched Desiree's decision to sever her ties to the Director. I should see where Gloria's leaning at this point. Maybe some of Gawain rubbed off on me last night but I really do hope they do it and regain their lost friendship. Or maybe it's just that with things being where they are with Insincere Marguerite and myself I'm projecting my own needs and desires onto their situation.<br /> <br /> But that's neither here nor there. Right now this deadly little slasher has a show to finish getting ready for. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Jacob\u2019s Journal</b><br /> <br /> After Luna and I got back to the Dream House Gloria came up and asked if she could have a private conversation with me for just a moment. I said sure and we went to another room. Gloria wanted advice on something and apparently wanted to get everyone\u2019s opinions separately. She was considering forming a motley with Desiree and moving into an apartment with her and wanted my opinion on the whole idea. She said that while she is with Desiree she is all for the idea of moving in together, but when they are apart the old insecurities come back and she starts to doubt herself. She remembers the old betrayals and fears that they will happen again. She wanted outside perspectives on the situation. So, I gave her my opinion. Desiree seems to have legitimately changed allegiances and be working for the good of the Freehold now. Unless she is playing a long con I think she has turned over a new leaf. So, I told Gloria as much and she went on to ask the next person on her mental list. I think she ended up talking to everyone that lives at the Dream House. I hope that I was right in the advice that I gave to Gloria. I do not want to see her get hurt again, nor do I want her to be betrayed. Desiree seems to have honestly changed sides, just like I did. I realized what harm my work for the Lady was doing, and found a reason, a someone, that convinced me that I didn\u2019t want to keep going down that path. Diane showed me that there was another side to things. That I could be a better person if I really wanted to. I expected no quarter and yet she gave it. I hope that Desiree experienced something along those lines. She certainly had reasons to go back to the Director, but has so far shown herself to have abandoned those goals.<br /> <br /> Later at the show Molly came over to the bar to talk. Apparently earlier when she was following Chalcedony she got spotted and the blue girl came up to talk to Molly. Chalcedony had been shopping so it wasn\u2019t odd to have run into Molly, but she still got spotted so now Molly can\u2019t keep watching her. If she were to get spotted again at a later date it is unlikely that Chalcedony will think that it was a coincidence. So, Dahlia took over Molly\u2019s assignment of watching Chalcedony. The disturbing thing about this whole situation was the way that Molly was describing the blue girl. She kept going on and on about how captivating her eyes were and how she got so lost in them that she lost track of what they were talking about. That doesn\u2019t sound normal to me. In fact it rings a little too close to how Insincere Marguerite was acting when she had been following Chalcedony. She had been obsessed with Chalcedony and wouldn\u2019t have anyone speak ill of her in her presence. I did not say anything overly insulting about Chalcedony, but I did express my trepidation over Molly\u2019s reaction and how I do not trust Chalcedony and neither should Molly. Gawain did not share my concerns and suggested that the next time Molly talks to the blue girl, she should compliment Chalcedony\u2019s eyes and go from there. I did not find his advice helpful. In fact, I thought it gave the opposite opinion that I was trying to get across. Calamity, when she came over to the bar, mirrored my concerns and tried to express that Molly should be careful. I do not know if Molly listened to me or not. I suppose time will tell. <br /> <br /> After that conversation Molly asked how to flirt and make conversation with people. I am not great with people, nor is Gawain so he suggested that Molly look at Lori as an example to follow. So, she did just that, she followed Lori around the club as the songstress made her rounds. I\u2019m pretty sure that Molly got plenty of good tips on how to flirt with people by the end of the night.<br /> <br /> Calamity came over to the bar after she had talked to Madame Spidertoes. They had been catching up with each other and Calamity had mentioned her experience with Leanne. That was either the very worst thing that she could have done, or a very right thing depending on your perspective. Madame Spidertoes got very upset and went absolutely still upon hearing Calamity\u2019s news. It took several reassurances on Calamity\u2019s part to calm down the elder Changeling. Apparently she got rather intense and scary which was worrying to Calamity and other people in the club that noticed. Well, at least to De La Rocha and Annika. Calamity assured her that Leanne had not been intentionally trying to kill her and that it was a mistake. Spidertoes said that no one was allowed to harm her Darklings without her permission. Eventually Spidertoes calmed down and Calamity came over to the bar to get a drink. Talking about Leanne might have been considered a bad thing to mention because there was the very real threat that Spidertoes might take it into her head to kill Leanne. It could also be considered a good thing because Spidertoes might be able to talk some sense into Leanne\u2019s head about any future dalliances with Calamity. Or anyone else for that matter. I\u2019m all for Leanne learning why it\u2019s a bad idea to mess with members of our Freehold. Spidertoes has the best interests of the Darklings in mind. The rest of us look after our own. <br /> <br /> De La Rocha got upset when Madame Spidertoes became angry. So much so that she eventually left the room. I think Lori was with her at the time, so I\u2019m sure that De La Rocha will be okay. Before that though Lori was making her rounds, talking and flirting with people as she went. She made her way to Joan and Andromeda\u2019s table where there as a little more than the usual flirting. Joan had it bad and you could tell just by looking at her. Lori for her part reciprocated in kind. Not subtle, those two. I\u2019m sure Molly got plenty of tips as she watched our winged motley mate. After that Lori spent a little longer than normal at White Maria\u2019s table, and in close proximity to Dark Kimberly. I\u2019m not sure what was said but I could tell that they were flirting pretty heavily. Not as hot and heavy as things were between Joan and Lori, but close. I don\u2019t know what\u2019s going on with those guys. Well, White Maria and various members of my motley. I know that White Maria has been seeing Insincere Marguerite and probably Julia by default, and now she seems to be making a play for Lori too. I guess time will tell on that one as well.<br /> <br /> There was more paring up after that too. Desiree spent some time hanging out with Gawain and the two got close. Eventually Gawain picked up Desiree and the smiling pair went in search of Calamity. I did not see Calamity leave so I\u2019m confident that they found her. At least no one that Calamity would leave with was at the club tonight. No Becky, no Leanne, so I\u2019m pretty sure she stuck around. <br /> <br /> **** **** ****<br /> <br /> This morning Gawain continued his waffle \u201ckick.\u201d He made Liege waffles, in plain and cinnamon flavors. They were good. I\u2019m looking forward to seeing what tomorrows waffles are like. White Maria, who was our guest this morning, seemed to like them as well. Conversation over breakfast turned to the upcoming holiday. I will admit that I had almost forgotten about Thanksgiving. I had been gone so long that I forgot about all those holidays that I celebrated as a child. All those holidays that I looked forward to since it usually meant that school was closed and I had a day off. So we discussed closing the club for Thanksgiving and the day after (Black Friday) since most folks will be celebrating the holiday with family and friends and not coming to a Burlesque House to see the shows. I believe that Insincere Marguerite, Julia, De La Rocha and Lori are all going to Julia\u2019s family\u2019s house for the holiday. I think they are going to have a good time. The rest of us will stay here and have our own Thanksgiving dinner, likely prepared by Gawain, but I will help where I can. I can make more than coffee.<br /> <br /> We also discussed opening up our Thanksgiving dinner to those in the Freehold that do not have a family to go home to, or a place to go for the holiday. I don\u2019t know how many people will take us up on the offer, but we should probably make the offer soon so we can get a count of how many people we\u2019re going to need to feed. We\u2019ll need to plan for plates and silverware for everyone too. We don\u2019t normally serve full dinners during shows, so we\u2019ll need to get that worked out too. Maybe we can do some things like a pot luck and have people bring different dishes for dinner or dessert. That might help take some of the stress off of Gawain and help ensure that we have enough food for everyone. I will bring that up to the others later.<br /> <br /> The disturbing bit came when White Maria decided to leave. She bowed to Insincere Marguerite and said \u201cMy Lady\u201d before heading out. It was a bit concerning because it means that Marguerite is assuming dominance over a good number of people, White Maria included. Normally that kind of thing wouldn\u2019t be that big a deal, but it seems worse to me because we are Changelings and because of my experiences in Arcadia. Insincere Marguerite does not need to \u201ccollect\u201d any more people. She has three girlfriends that she is pretty committed to, plus a few other lovers. But this was the first of the other lovers that acted that deferential to Marguerite. Insincere Marguerite admitted that she collected people when she was in Arcadia. It just seems to me that she is continuing that trend here in the world, which is disturbing in an of itself. Plus, there is the whole \u201cLady\u201d thing. I think that phrase is forever ruined for me because I will always think of The Lady of the Winter Winds when I hear it. It will never have a positive or normal connotation for me. So, it just seems wrong to have someone refer to Insincere Marguerite as My Lady. Marguerite is my friend and I care for her. I do not want to see her go down that path any further than she already has.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Insincere Marguerite\u2019s Whispers</b><br /> <br /> <b>Moonlight Shadow</b><br /> <br /> Julia opened her eyes and saw darkness. But she felt that one of the two other people in bed had moved, and heard the telltale sound of the vent. She slowly sat up, and slid out of bed.<br /> <br /> \u201cBon-Bon?\u201d<br /> <br /> The sound stopped at her whispered words. She heard the vent again, and while it was too dark to see in the room, she felt movement, and a presence moved closer.<br /> <br /> \u201cLove?\u201d<br /> <br /> She had learned where Insincere Marguerite\u2019s voice came from based on their heights, the French Darkling being over half a foot shorter. She reached out gently, and found her shoulder, running her hand through the long blonde hair.<br /> <br /> \u201cBon-Bon, must you sleep in the vents tonight? I mean if you must you must but\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> There was a pause, then, \u201cNon.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cGood.\u201d Julia\u2019s long dexterous fingers moved through Insincere Marguerite\u2019s hair. They then moved to cup the back of her head as Julia kissed the small woman\u2019s forehead. She gathered a robe about herself and moved through the door, while the Tunnelgrub followed behind her into the hall in the altogether.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat\u2019s bothering you?\u201d The artist leaned on the wall. Lorelei\u2019s room was silent now, she and Maria\u2019s experimenting with chemicals having led to a hard sleep. The light in the hall was dim, the way the Darklings like it.<br /> <br /> \u201cI feel that there is tensions in our family that should not be there. I worry about us checking ourselves sometimes, as if Lorelei cannot be too good to me, or she feels as though she cannot, without upsetting you.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Nightsinger crossed her arms. \u201cShe has been pretty good to you recently, Insincere Marguerite.<br /> <br /> The smaller woman walked up to her fianc\u00e9e, her cat-like eyes luminous in the darkness. <br /> \u201cThat is what I am talking about. Yes. Come. Come so you can see. See Me.\u201d<br /> <br /> The two walked into the hallway, then out to the covered porch. It was illuminated by moonlight, and the Frenchwoman looked pale and vulnerable she turned back to the Artist.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you are jealous, then you and I and she need to talk about it. I am going to stay with you but I do not want the family to be hurt.\u201d Her big blue eyes were pleading. Julia couldn\u2019t help but notice how beautiful they were. But the pale light made her lover gaunt. She stepped up and cupped her face in her hands. The shadows lent it a healthier look. Darkness conceals. \u201cI don\u2019t want to hurt her. Or you. I don\u2019t want to feel this way.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIs it my actions that are making you jealous?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHer shirts\u2026.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI will not wear them. She loses nothing. You lose nothing,\u201d The Tunnelgrub waved her hand idly, \u201cI will make the sacrifice. I will be fine.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou are sure?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI also want you to understand I am not going to leave you. There was and is a pledge\u2026.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u201cWhy won\u2019t they pledge with us?\u201d Julia cut her lover off. The Lurker was thrown by the change, pausing with her mouth open, but caught up quickly. Julia paced now, a few steps away.<br /> <br /> \u201cBoth of them are afraid of commitment beyond their word. I mean, they are not, you know, given to breaking their word,\u201d Insincere Marguerite struggled to phrase things neutrally, \u201c But breaking a pledge, breaking a marriage vow those are\u2026different. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cLori seems big on commitment to me, till I come into the picture.\u201d She was looking away. <br /> <br /> Insincere Marguerite shivered. Perhaps a robe would have been in order. She rather missed walking the house nude though. \u201cLori is committed to you. You are being unkind, love.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThen why won\u2019t they pledge? It hurts!\u201d Julia shouted. There were tears now. The Tunnelgrub walked up, and put her arms around the taller woman. \u201cMy love, there is a difference between not loving us enough, and not being ready.\u201d With a finger, she turned Julia\u2019s face to look at her. Again those blue eyes. They made Julia weak. <br /> <br /> \u201cYou see how much they love one another, yet they will not even pledge to each other. They are nervous\u2026not ready\u2026five years ago I would have been the way, hein? \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cI am the youngest of us\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI know. But you are given to commitment. It was difficult to convince you to, remember, dally with them despite your feelings. But now, it seems normal.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s true. I will give her time. I love her, and you, I love all of\u2026.,\u201d She looks past her fianc\u00e9e, causing the Lurker to turn. White Maria had walked up, bathed in moonlight in only a robe. Staring glassily at Insincere Marguerite, she dropped her robe, her white skin shining. \u201cMy Lady.\u201d<br /> <br /> Insincere Marguerite and Julia looked at each other, then back to White Maria. \u201cIt is chilly. Return to the room. I will be right there, hein?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYes, My Lady.\u201d<br /> <br /> She turned and walked away, leaving the robe on the ground. The Frenchwoman put it on. She turned to her love. \u201cWat to go in?\u201d<br /> <br /> Julia nodded. White Maria got very\u2026pliable as well as submissive. Beautiful and amazingly silken as she was, it creeped the Nightsinger out a little nonetheless. Then a second thought occurred to her.<br /> <br /> \u201cBon-Bon\u2026by the way what did you find in Rowan\u2019s house?\u201d<br /> <br /> The Darkling turned. \u201cNothing suspicious. Well, except that everything seemed to be the same age, and the uncanny feeling of being watched.\u201d She gave Julia a significant look, then followed White Maria inside with a slight shiver. Julia was unsure if it was from cold.<br /> <br /> She looked out at the woods, back toward the house, then to the woods again. \u201cWhat a fascinating work we have become. I wonder if I painted our fate, what it would be. \u201c She lowered her head in thought. \u201cIt\u2019s never come out well. Perhaps it will be different this time.\u201d<br /> <br /> She looked toward Lori\u2019s bedroom, and then toward the house. \u201cPerhaps it would not.\u201d<br /> <br /> With that, she followed her fianc\u00e9e inside. The door closed behind her. Tonight everyone in the Last Dance was safe. Tonight.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session LXIII</i><br /> <br /> The Version of Little Red Riding Hood discussed was the Amanda Seyfried version. If you haven\u2019t heard it maybe you should.<br /> <br /> I felt I did a good job of making Spidertoes really, really creepy when upset, her mannerisms getting less and less human.<br /> <br /> Oh, lets see. The scene with Molly shadowing Lori was funny as she could not roll nearly well enough to notice the Manikin\u2019s observation. Insincere Marguerite\u2019s story took place that first night, before the liege waffles, not after the show the story was building up to. <br /> <br /> I like how the journals catch different things. Only Lori recorded the Titanic reference, only Jacob noted White Maria\u2019s rather submissive behavior when she left. <br /> <br /> I think that covers it. Comments and Questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T19:45:35-07:00","id":960812,"title":"","content":"If someone was curious about the details of an NPC (say, Tommy Rawhead's durance, for example) that haven't been revealed in play yet, would you prefer questions be asked via private message, or would you prefer not to answer them until the details are revealed in play, if ever?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2286-indarkestknight","name":"indarkestknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T03:03:19-07:00","id":960956,"title":"","content":"You can ask here, if I need to PM you I will post that, otherwise will answer here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T16:53:59-07:00","id":961291,"title":"","content":"I can't believe how concerned I felt about the emotional well-being of Julia and Calamity to only name those two. That's proof of how alive they feel right there.<br /> Rowan seems to have an interesting story, I look forward to learning more about her!<br /> I've noticed that Gawain and Jacob's situations and relationships seem more stable than the ladies'. Is it just my perception?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T19:20:16-07:00","id":961353,"title":"","content":"Forgive my lack of understanding, but why would Joan not being Jewish be significant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:55:07-07:00","id":961483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play?p=961353#post961353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Forgive my lack of understanding, but why would Joan not being Jewish be significant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Putting aside the contentious nature many religions have when someone not in their faith joins their families, it also provides friction during holiday celebrations. Christmas may have more or less stretched from its Christian (or at least its original) roots, but there are those in other religions who don't celebrate it, nor Easter. If you had a child who was involved with someone who didn't celebrate the holidays, or even mocked them, it'd make it tense when visiting the inlaws or trying to connect with them during said holidays.<br /> <br /> I'm fairly certain Joan would still make the effort to properly celebrate the holidays with Andromeda's family, but they may not take to her even if they're accepting of the relationship itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:56:24-07:00","id":961484,"title":"","content":"Well, to be entirely honest, I am rather curious about Tommy's durance...<br /> <br /> Anaheim's a decent ways away from Hollywood, Malibu, and Santa Monica, so I can't imagine it falls under the jurisdiction of any of the Freeholds we know about. Does any Freehold claim it? Or is it, like most of the LA area, a No Man's Land/neutral territory? (Apologies if this was addressed at some point and I glossed over it when reading.) With the smorgasbord of glamour available, it seems like it'd be a hot piece of real estate for Changelings.<br /> <br /> Less a question, more an observation that it feels like it's been some time since we've last seen good Captain Jack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2286,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2286-indarkestknight","user":"indarkestknight","date":". 09-01-2016, 04:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2286-indarkestknight","name":"indarkestknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T03:09:19-07:00","id":961543,"title":"","content":"Anteros: Thanks for that feedback. While the Darklings get themselves sorted, there is Tension. I am glad it is gripping to you as well. This game has a major drama/supernatural romance element, and that is needed to keep it interesting. <br /> <br /> Jacob has a stable love life. Gawain is involved with Calamity and to a lesser degree Desiree, neither of whom are stable. We get a look at what is really going on with Desiree next session, mostly from Jacob and Insincere Marguerite. Luna is, overall, pretty stable herself, unusual back story aside.<br /> <br /> Omenseer: Andromeda's family, and presumably Andromeda herself are Jewish, though she never commented whether she was or not. Joan is a Christian, and disinterested in converting, which is not an issue for Andromeda but could be for getting her accepted by the family.<br /> <br /> Taidragon: Got it in one.<br /> <br /> Indarkestknight: Will PM. I have really not worked on Anaheim Courts; they would be outside the scope of this story. However, with player interest I could flesh them out, but I prefer to focus on more recurrent NPCs and stories.<br /> <br /> Captain Jack may appear for Thanksgiving shhhhhhhhhh don't tell anyone.<br /> <br /> Thanks all for feedback love to hear from you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 09-01-2016, 06:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T14:47:41-07:00","id":961913,"title":"","content":"Had no idea Andromeda was Jewish, but i do love seeing my brothers and sisters represented","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T16:17:04-07:00","id":961959,"title":"","content":"I have several Jewish NPCs, but it does not come up as much. I will try to have that come out a bit...she is one of three Jewish Changelings in MDH.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1