ost1043093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He is, with Master Darke, Doctor Bright, Molly Nuit, Vic Twilight and formally Mr. Grey. Hard to say who the Calamity of that bunch is.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;One down, three to go...&quot; -Calamity<br /> <br /> Actually, while she wouldn't say it to Gawain or Lori, she does feel that the freehold needs monsters like Darke and his crew to help keep the Gentry at bay. It's just important to keep them on a leash. (And yes, she does realize that by this logic her own pledge to the Winter Monarch is a valid thing. Just because she knows it's logical and reasonable doesn't mean she has to like it.) <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4217-amberghylles","name":"Amberghylles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T18:27:59-08:00","id":1044311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amberghylles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play?p=1044212#post1044212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just because she knows it's logical and reasonable doesn't mean she has to like it.)</div> </div> </div>